        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Silk panel embroidered with silk and gilt threads, Japan, 18th century"@en , "Panel of black silk embroidered with silk and gilt thread in satin, stem-stitch and couched work. Shisu embroidery. Embroidered decoration depicts small auspicious symbols: cranes, pines, eight Buddhist treasures, and tortoise, all in orange, lime green, blue green, dark blue, white and gold."@en ;
